#### Temporal Integration
```python
worker = Worker(
    temporal_client=temporal_client,
    workflow_classes=[PostgresMetadataExtractionWorkflow],
    temporal_activities=PostgresMetadataExtractionWorkflow.get_activities(activities),
    passthrough_modules=["application_sdk", "pandas", "os", "app"],
    max_concurrent_activities=MAX_CONCURRENT_ACTIVITIES,
)
```

- Manages workflow execution
- Handles activity scheduling
- Provides state management
- Ensures fault tolerance

### 2. Frontend Implementation

#### Multi-step Interface
1. Connection Configuration
   - Authentication method selection
   - Credential input
