```python
class PostgresAtlasTransformer(AtlasTransformer):
    def __init__(self, connector_name: str, tenant_id: str, **kwargs: Any):
        self.entity_class_definitions = {
            "TABLE": PostgresTable,
            "COLUMN": PostgresColumn,
            "EXTRAS-PROCEDURE": Procedure
        }
```

